  "statement_alignment": "C01 is the metric-derived general-Lambda coordinate Riemann/Einstein identity under local TOV first derivatives and the derived lapse second derivative. C02 proves general-Lambda matched frame curvature before specializing Lambda=0 and mu=kappa epsilon0/6 for the full pointwise Weyl zero tensor, covariant Weyl derivative, static rates and actual acceleration norm. C03 derives fixed-action metric and scalar first variations, radial pressure/energy first derivatives, and a conditional second lapse derivative from local action-source TOV equality; Pstar,q are fixed. C04 is a universal positive-real left-limit theorem for conditional actual-metric germ families. Analytic existence, DEC persistence, whole-interval action/TOV uniqueness and distinct-germ interpretation remain HOLD.",
